        {
          "es": "Antes de nacer, los gemelos ya discutían.",
          "en": "Before they were born, the twins were already arguing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Uno dijo: «Nacerá por el camino de siempre».",
          "en": "One said, \"I will be born the usual way.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "El otro dijo: «¡Yo veo luz por allá! Saldré por ahí».",
          "en": "The other said, \"I see light over there. I will go out that way!\""
        }
