        {
          "es": "El primero nació con calma. Era amable, y lo llamarían Brote.",
          "en": "The first twin was born calmly. He was kind, and would be called Sapling."
        },
        {
          "es": "El segundo no quiso esperar y salió por otro camino. Su cuerpo era duro como la piedra: Pedernal.",
          "en": "The second would not wait. His body was hard as stone: Flint."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su madre no sobrevivió.",
          "en": "Their mother did not survive."
        }
